{
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "新斗篷啊？真时髦！来，收下这份礼物吧，你知道达弗从不亏待你！",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_introduction",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "谢谢",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "谢谢您，达弗大人。你总是如此慷慨，我感激不尽。",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "嘿嘿… 呃… 是啊，当然，不客气",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_endeared",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient": "（她的声音居然是这样的！？）",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_fear",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "你是比较话多的那个，是吧？我开始学会怎么分辨你们了！",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_introduction",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.char": "你的收藏里有毒药吗？我得找点更厉害的东西。",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient": "我能给你搞到！那些坏蛋是不是都产生抗性了？",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_endeared",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "对",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.char": "哦，不，这不是给他们的。",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.char": "看到高塔中没有巨蛇的迷雾真是奇怪。\n我必须纠正这一切。",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient": "[sine]…上升.. ..找到[red]建筑师[/red]... ..[jitter]杀[/jitter]…[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_welcome",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "拒绝",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.char": "不，我需要他再次透过被蒙蔽的双眼看清楚。",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient": "[sine]...足够... ...接近了...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_curious",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.char": "我的巨蛇……必须要将这个世界纳入你的盘绕。",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.char": "这份清醒会要了我的命。",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient": "[sine]...以毒.. ..攻毒...?[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_welcome",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "回绝",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.char": "你的世界里没有足够强效的毒液。\n绝大部分我都试过了…",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "你和涅奥的另一个傀儡不一样对吧？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_welcome",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "的确",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "我尊敬涅奥夫人，但我侍奉的是巨蛇，而不是她。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "你居然会说话！这难道不有趣吗？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_giggle",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "打破你的誓言会钝化你杀手的锋芒吗？\n我们只能拭目以待了，不是吗？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_welcome",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient": "我一直对她很好奇。另一个你",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_welcome",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "令人失望",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.char": "我根本无法揣测她的心思。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.char": "看的太透，才是愚蠢，其毒性比刀刃上的任何毒液都要致命。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-3.ancient": "你拼命躲避真实的自己。\n我真想知道你在害怕找到什么。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-3.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_grossed_out",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "没有荒疫？你痊愈了！！太棒了！！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "提问",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "“荒疫……？”哦！这种困惑倒挺让人高兴的。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "而且现在还会说话了！原来荒疫还有这种效果！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "你是会说话的那个？？\n跟我说说蛇朋友！跟我说！跟我说！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.char": "欧洛巴斯，你一定用你那只巨眼看到了许多东西吧。",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient": "哇！是的！太多了！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "追问",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.char": "体验这种无尽的清晰感，有让你感到负担吗？",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-3.ancient": "不！绝不！看到好多东西！！喜欢看东西！！！",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.char": "佩尔大人！我一直带着一剂您惯用的酊剂，免得您被不受抑制的梦境所困扰。",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient": "[thinky_dots]...zzzzZZZZzzzz...[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "就留给他吧",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.char": "当然，那么请允许我把它留在这里。",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.char": "他睡得如此安详，也许我并不怀念他那翻来覆去的样子……",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]那东西… 你给我喝了什么…？[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "解释",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.char": "毒芹和当地异蛇毒液的混合物。\n你不喜欢吗？",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]我的梦… 如此可怕的形状… 你究竟是什么…？[/thinky_dots]",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "女猎手！你在这儿！我们还没打一场你就不见了！！",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "纠正",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "恐怕您认错人了。",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "你怎么在说话！？太吓人了！！！",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "这么多匕首！匕首够多就能变得强大吗？？",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient": "与我一战，侍僧！",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "布道",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.char": "[i][font_size=22]转而分享了一段她的宗教典籍。[/font_size][/i]",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient": "别念了！我投降！！",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "[jitter][b]你…[/b][/jitter]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient": "你和另一个不一样，我看得出来。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "承认",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.char": "巨蛇教导我们，我们皆不相同。然而，我们本是一体。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient": "哦，不，你一点都不像她！\n不过，说不定你确实像她，比你以为的还要像……",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "可怜的小家伙，已经没有地方能成为你的[jitter][b]归宿[/b][/jitter]了。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.char": "特兹卡塔拉女士…请允许我坦白，唯独您仍使我感到陌生",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient": "亲爱的，以我对你的巨蛇的了解……\n也许我是唯一一只足够机灵、知道要逃离这艘沉船的老鼠。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]特兹卡塔拉阴沉地咯咯笑起来，连侍僧都不由得顿了一顿。[/font_size][/i]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_DEFECT.0-0r.char": "我对建筑师感到愤怒",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_DEFECT.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_DEFECT.0-1r.ancient": "死吧",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_DEFECT.0-attack": "BOTH",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-0r.ancient": "你到底是什么东西？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-0r.next": "威胁",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-1r.char": "放马过来…\n鼠辈…",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-2r.ancient": "啊，当然了，又一个。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-0r.ancient": "还不服？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-0r.next": "威胁",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-1r.char": "吾必取汝性命…",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-2r.ancient": "你真是个废物。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-0r.ancient": "这种执着并不令人敬佩。只让人觉得可悲。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-0r.next": "威胁",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-1r.char": "吾将攀登无数次……直至取汝性命。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-2r.ancient": "让大地吞噬你吧，这是终结你痛苦的唯一方式。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_NECROBINDER.0-0r.char": "我对建筑师感到愤怒",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_NECROBINDER.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_NECROBINDER.0-1r.ancient": "死吧",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_NECROBINDER.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-0.char": "啊嗬咿——！我说，这些破烂里看起来有些值钱的玩意啊。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-0.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-1.ancient": "太棒了，又一个麻烦",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-1.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-2.char": "你觉得我是个麻烦？行啊，我这就让你见识见识什么叫真正的麻烦！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-0r.char": "猜猜谁回来了！你想我了吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-1r.ancient": "算是想了吧。 ",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-1r.next": "回复",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-2r.char": "哎呀，我也想你了！等等，那道光是什么？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-0r.char": "你考虑过装个电梯吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-1r.ancient": "你考虑过放过我吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-1r.next": "嘲讽",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-2r.char": "还真没想过。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.char": "你必须放下你的愤怒，建筑师！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "加入我，一起感受蛇的怀抱吧。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "你不是应该保持安静吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.next": "解释",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.char": "只要我还有指引迷途之人的使命，就不可能沉默。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-4.ancient": "你的使命是闭嘴。",
